# DevOps

MVP target: `docker compose up` runs API, worker, Redis, frontend, and FFmpeg-capable worker image. CPU-only; no GPU required.

## Images and Compose

Multi-stage builds, non-root where practical, healthchecks, explicit env files. No secrets in Dockerfiles or committed `.env`. Separate dev vs production bind-mounts and debug flags.

Do not bake models, API keys, or host paths into images.

## Dependencies

Add a package only after checking: existing lib, maintenance, license, security, size, runtime cost, necessity. Do not add deps for one-liners the stdlib already covers.

## Observability

Structured logs: `job_id`, `chunk_id`, provider, model, `source_language`, `target_language`, duration, character count, status, retry count, `error_type`. Correlation via `job_id`. No secrets, no full story payloads.
